{
  "$comment": "Names the team chose over upstream's, applied after the model and compat rules. `paths` rewrites every path segment containing `from`, or with `exact: true` only a segment equal to it. `omit` drops upstream files the kit does not ship, such as `make-bot-ui`, which builds pages for the upstream editor's Grok Bot. `rules` rewrite text the same way model-map.json rules do: literal, scoped by upstream path glob, with an exact count. `forbidden` fails the sync if a vendored file still contains the pattern, apart from LICENSE files (whose copyright lines the license requires), the listed words, and the listed per-file exceptions. Faker is the League of Legends player; the mode and its agent carry his name on this team. The upstream editor's name is kept out of the kit.",
